{"seq":4,"slug":"viper","title":"VIPER 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/architecture-patterns/viper","wordCount":713,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"viper-架构\">VIPER 架构</h1><p>VIPER 是 iOS 社区中一种高度模块化的架构模式，将每个屏幕拆分为五个独立组件：View、Interactor、Presenter、Entity、Router。本文详细解析各组件的职责、模块生成方式以及 VIPER 的优缺点。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>VIPER 把每个屏幕的职责拆成五个各司其职的组件，组件之间通过协议交互，形成清晰的责任边界。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>View</strong>：UI 展示与用户交互，持有 Presenter</li>\n<li><strong>Interactor</strong>：业务逻辑与数据获取，被 Presenter 持有</li>\n<li><strong>Presenter</strong>：协调 View 与 Interactor，持有 Interactor 和 Router</li>\n<li><strong>Entity</strong>：数据模型，被 Interactor 使用</li>\n<li><strong>Router</strong>：页面跳转与模块装配，被 Presenter 持有</li>\n</ul>\n<p>核心思想是<strong>单一职责</strong>——每个组件只做一件事，并通过协议解耦。代价是单个屏幕的组件数量与协议定义显著增多，因此 VIPER 更适合大型团队与复杂页面。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"viper-组件概览\">VIPER 组件概览</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    View --&gt;|用户操作| Presenter&#10;    Presenter --&gt;|更新视图| View&#10;    Presenter --&gt;|请求数据| Interactor&#10;    Interactor --&gt;|返回结果| Presenter&#10;    Presenter --&gt;|路由请求| Router&#10;    Router --&gt;|展示新页面| View&#10;    Interactor --&gt; Entity&#10;&#10;    classDef v fill:none,stroke:#2196F3&#10;    classDef i fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50&#10;    classDef p fill:none,stroke:#FF9800&#10;    classDef e fill:none,stroke:#9C27B0&#10;    classDef r fill:none,stroke:#F44336&#10;&#10;    class View v&#10;    class Interactor i&#10;    class Presenter p&#10;    class Entity e&#10;    class Router r\">graph TD\n    View --&gt;|用户操作| Presenter\n    Presenter --&gt;|更新视图| View\n    Presenter --&gt;|请求数据| Interactor\n    Interactor --&gt;|返回结果| Presenter\n    Presenter --&gt;|路由请求| Router\n    Router --&gt;|展示新页面| View\n    Interactor --&gt; Entity\n\n    classDef v fill:none,stroke:#2196F3\n    classDef i fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50\n    classDef p fill:none,stroke:#FF9800\n    classDef e fill:none,stroke:#9C27B0\n    classDef r fill:none,stroke:#F44336\n\n    class View v\n    class Interactor i\n    class Presenter p\n    class Entity e\n    class Router r</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>持有关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>View</td>\n<td>UI 展示与用户交互</td>\n<td>持有 Presenter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Interactor</td>\n<td>业务逻辑与数据获取</td>\n<td>被 Presenter 持有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Presenter</td>\n<td>协调 View 与 Interactor</td>\n<td>持有 Interactor 和 Router</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Entity</td>\n<td>数据模型</td>\n<td>被 Interactor 使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Router</td>\n<td>页面跳转与模块装配</td>\n<td>被 Presenter 持有</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"协议定义\">协议定义</h2><p>VIPER 通过协议明确每个组件的接口边界：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"protocol UserListViewProtocol: AnyObject {&#10;    var presenter: UserListPresenterProtocol? { get set }&#10;    func showUsers(_ users: [UserEntity])&#10;    func showError(_ message: String)&#10;    func showLoading()&#10;    func hideLoading()&#10;}&#10;&#10;protocol UserListPresenterProtocol: AnyObject {&#10;    var view: UserListViewProtocol? { get set }&#10;    var interactor: UserListInteractorInputProtocol? { get set }&#10;    var router: UserListRouterProtocol? { get set }&#10;    func viewDidLoad()&#10;    func didSelectUser(_ user: UserEntity)&#10;}&#10;&#10;protocol UserListInteractorInputProtocol: AnyObject {&#10;    var presenter: UserListInteractorOutputProtocol? { get set }&#10;    func fetchUsers()&#10;}&#10;&#10;protocol UserListInteractorOutputProtocol: AnyObject {&#10;    func didFetchUsers(_ users: [UserEntity])&#10;    func didFailFetchingUsers(_ error: Error)&#10;}&#10;&#10;protocol UserListRouterProtocol: AnyObject {&#10;    static func createModule() -&gt; UIViewController&#10;    func navigateToUserDetail(from view: UserListViewProtocol, with user: UserEntity)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shik