        sourceVC.navigationController</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pushViewController</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(detailVC, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">animated</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"模块生成\">模块生成</h2><p>由于 VIPER 每个模块需要多个文件，推荐使用代码生成工具：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    Template[&quot;模板文件&quot;] --&gt; Generator[&quot;代码生成器&quot;]&#10;    ModuleName[&quot;模块名称&quot;] --&gt; Generator&#10;    Generator --&gt; Protocols[&quot;Protocols.swift&quot;]&#10;    Generator --&gt; ViewFile[&quot;View.swift&quot;]&#10;    Generator --&gt; PresenterFile[&quot;Presenter.swift&quot;]&#10;    Generator --&gt; InteractorFile[&quot;Interactor.swift&quot;]&#10;    Generator --&gt; RouterFile[&quot;Router.swift&quot;]&#10;&#10;    classDef gen fill:none,stroke:#FF9800&#10;    class Generator gen\">graph LR\n    Template[\"模板文件\"] --&gt; Generator[\"代码生成器\"]\n    ModuleName[\"模块名称\"] --&gt; Generator\n    Generator --&gt; Protocols[\"Protocols.swift\"]\n    Generator --&gt; ViewFile[\"View.swift\"]\n    Generator --&gt; PresenterFile[\"Presenter.swift\"]\n    Generator --&gt; InteractorFile[\"Interactor.swift\"]\n    Generator --&gt; RouterFile[\"Router.swift\"]\n\n    classDef gen fill:none,stroke:#FF9800\n    class Generator gen</pre><p>典型的模块文件结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"UserList/&#10;├── UserListProtocols.swift&#10;├── UserListView.swift&#10;├── UserListPresenter.swift&#10;├── UserListInteractor.swift&#10;├── UserListRouter.swift&#10;└── UserListEntity.swift\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>UserList/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── UserListProtocols.swift</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── UserListView.swift</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── UserListPresenter.swift</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── UserListInteractor.swift</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── UserListRouter.swift</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── UserListEntity.swift</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 社区工具如 Generamba 或自定义 Xcode Template 可以一键生成 VIPER 模块骨架代码。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"优缺点分析\">优缺点分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>职责分离</td>\n<td>每个组件职责单一明确</td>\n<td>简单页面也需要五个文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可测试性</td>\n<td>每个组件可独立测试</td>\n<td>协议数量多，Mock 工作量大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>团队协作</td>\n<td>并行开发互不干扰</td>\n<td>学习曲线陡峭</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模块化</td>\n<td>天然支持模块化拆分</td>\n<td>模块间通信复杂度高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码量</td>\n<td>结构清晰可维护</td>\n<td>样板代码多</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SwiftUI</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>与 SwiftUI 适配困难</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"viper-与其他架构对比\">VIPER 与其他架构对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>MVC</th>\n<th>MVVM</th>\n<th>VIPER</th>\n<th>TCA</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>组件数量</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路由方式</td>\n<td>VC 直接跳转</td>\n<td>ViewModel/Coordinator</td>\n<td>Router 模块</td>\n<td>状态驱动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>副作用管理</td>\n<td>散布各处</td>\n<td>ViewModel</td>\n<td>Interactor</td>\n<td>Effect 系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SwiftUI 支持</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>优</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用规模</td>\n<td>小型</td>\n<td>中型</td>\n<td>大型</td>\n<td>中大型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>VIPER 将屏幕拆分为 View/Interactor/Presenter/Entity/Router 五个组件</li>\n<li>通过协议定义组件间接口，实现彻底的关注点分离</li>\n<li>Router 承担模块装配和页面导航职责，是 VIPER 模块的入口</li>\n<li>代码生成工具可以大幅降低 VIPER 的样板代码负担</li>\n<li>VIPER 最适合 UIKit 大型团队项目，对 SwiftUI 项目不推荐</li>\n<li>选择架构时需权衡项目规模、团队经验和技术栈适配度</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"VIPER 架构","id":"viper-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"VIPER 组件概览","id":"viper-组件概览"},{"level":2,"text":"协议定义","id":"协议定义"},{"level":2,"text":"各组件实现","id":"各组件实现"},{"level":3,"text":"Entity","id":"entity"},{"level":3,"text":"Interactor","id":"interactor"},{"level":3,"text":"Presenter","id":"presenter"},{"level":3,"text":"Router（模块装配）","id":"router-模块装配"},{"level":2,"text":"模块生成","id":"模块生成"},{"level":2,"text":"优缺点分析","id":"优缺点分析"},{"level":2,"text":"VIPER 与其他架构对比","id":"viper-与其他架构对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"整洁架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/architecture-patterns/clean-architecture"},"next":{"title":"模块边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/modular-design/module-boundaries"}}